@kevinmcconnell I've simplified the structure, but there are two issues preventing me from using exactly the same approach for paginating notifications and the activity:

- In those, the pagination link is placed outside of the container that contains the elements. So, the stream will just replace the link. Here, if I place the button outside the link, it will break the grid layout completely. So here I can't use the same simpler "replace" approach.
